# Signal Reference Boundary

- Use the Signal repository only as behavioral and protocol evidence.
- Reimplement accepted behavior against ERC-chart contracts and architecture.
- Do not copy Signal source, module structure, runtime architecture, or browser/userscript mechanics.
- Do not introduce a Signal dependency or import path.
- Record parity as tests, requirements, or provider protocol findings without credentials.
